Z||000000||BAM-BAM||07-12-2000||12:44 AM||||  Got a few questions. How much more difficult is it to swap in a 3.4L DOHC vs. a<BR>regular 3.4? How much are the neccessary adapter kits? Is it worth it? Can this be done without expensive adapters (build your own)? Has this been done (home made adapters)? I might have an opportunity here and need some expert advise. What do ya say? Think I should? It would take alot of convincing (the wife). LMK and TIA  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>  Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
