Z||000032||terryk||07-16-2000||04:21 PM||||1. NC<BR>2. PPL - SERIAL DATA 10200 BAUD<BR>3. LT GRN - DIAG ENABLE<BR>4. BLK - GROUND<BR>5. BLK/WHT - PCM GROUND<BR>6. NC<BR>7. NC<BR>8. BLK/WHT - KEYLESS ENTRY ENABLE<BR>9. TAN - SERIAL DATA 8192 BAUD<BR>10. NC<BR>11. NC<BR>12. NC<BR>13. NC<BR>14. DRk GRN - DIAG SIGNAL FOR ENTERTAINMENT<BR>15. NC<BR>16. ORN - FUSE OUTPUT BATTERY <P>With no VSS it could be going into ABM.<P>Terry<BR> ||||reg||1
